    "iOS 不告诉 App 你允许了哪几项健康数据，所以这里只能说问过了。去「健康」App 的「共享」里可以逐项查看和更改。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS does not tell apps which health data you allowed, so all this can say is that you were asked. You can see and change each one under Sharing in the Health app."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS no dice a las apps qué datos de salud permitiste, así que esto solo puede decir que te lo preguntó. Puedes ver y cambiar cada uno en Compartir, dentro de la app Salud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 不告诉 App 你允许了哪几项健康数据，所以这里只能说问过了。要逐项查看和更改：打开「健康」App，点右上角的头像，在「隐私」下面进「App」，再选 Fish Pocket。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS does not tell an app which kinds of health data you allowed, so all this page can say is that you were asked. To see and change them one by one: open the Health app, tap your picture at the top right, go to Apps under Privacy, then choose Fish Pocket."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS no le dice a una app qué datos de salud permitiste, así que esta página solo puede decir que se te preguntó. Para verlos y cambiarlos uno por uno: abre la app Salud, toca tu foto arriba a la derecha, entra en Apps dentro de Privacidad y elige Fish Pocket."
          }
        }
      }
    },
