    "「%@」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」\n任务将停止触发，并连同其已保存的任务运行记录一并删除。原会话及其消息仍然保留；已排队的消息不会被撤回。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”\nThis stops the task from triggering and deletes it together with its saved delivery records. The original session and its messages remain; queued messages are not withdrawn."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@»\nEsta tarea dejará de activarse y se eliminará junto con sus registros de ejecución guardados. La sesión original y sus mensajes se conservan; los mensajes en cola no se retiran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」带网页界面部分，iOS 无法运行，已告知 Agent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” has a web UI part that can't run on iOS; the agent has been told"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» tiene una parte de interfaz web que no puede ejecutarse en iOS; se le informó al agente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」这个名字已经被占用了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The name “%@” is already taken"
