    "参数值写入请求的推理强度字段，默认与档位名相同。Off 表示关闭思考。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The API value is sent in the request’s reasoning-effort field and defaults to the level name. Off turns reasoning off."
