            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La instalación del complemento «%@» ha fallado. Averigua por qué. Arréglalo si puedes; si no, dime qué hacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我装了插件「%@」，但找不到它，也不知道怎么用。告诉我它在哪里、怎么用；如果它没有生效，帮我查出原因。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I installed the plugin “%@” but can't find it and don't know how to use it. Tell me where it is and how to use it. If it isn't working, find out why."
